#### BUG-030 — MEDIUM — Full-suite mail mock pollution from module-level executor
- **Location:** `ADMIN/tests.py:238-274` (`mock.patch("resend.Emails.send")`, `params()` asserts `call_count == 1`); `SERVICE_INTERNAL/email_single.py:22-24`.
