### 3.6 Admin and staff surfaces

#### BUG-054 — MEDIUM — Ads desk card actions have no no-JS fallback despite claiming one
- **Location:** `ADMIN/templates/ADMIN/partials/advert_reference_card.html:1-5,50-76`; `ADMIN/views.py:3180-3203`.
