#### BUG-070 — LOW — Stale root `robots.txt` contradicts the live dynamic view
- **Location:** `robots.txt:8-10` (“Sitemap: https://abureport.com/sitemap.xml” and “# NOT THE REAL ONE , JUST FOR UNIT TEST”); `NoName/urls.py:47` serves `RobotsTxtView`.
- **Impact:** Developer confusion and SEO misconfiguration risk if a web server ever serves the static file instead of the dynamic view; domain also contradicts the canonical `.com.ng`.
